{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549900/extras/cutskull.png?t=1749843470\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The third in an epic five-part DLC series that adds legendary ships to the Caribbean waters, all connected by a tragic story.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Mortimer Grim, the slavers' scourge, is on the hunt again. There are many stories about ghost ships and most of them are fairy tales, but the truth behind the mighty brig Memento is truly terrifying.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Purchase and you'll get:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A global map event, available in both story and sandbox modes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">True pirate gear - cutlass, hat and spyglass</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A boss fight with Death itself</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A mighty brig</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four new achievements</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Gameplay tips:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can upgrade the cutlass... if you are close enough to Grim's ideas</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can attack the Memento anytime, but consider sending a launch to her first</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The boss fight is designed for a character of at least level 15 with decent equipment, officers, artillery and boarding skills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549900/extras/items.jpg?t=1749843470\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549900/extras/mementoq.png?t=1749843470\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549900?t=1749843470","background_